# Testimony Of Fate (Q219), a second class-change test for dark elves, first part: a level 38 Palus Knight, who already holds
# the ingredients Ixia asks for but the tenth marsh spider fluid, is sent by Kaira to Metheus (who pays the diamonds of the
# level 37 set), kills the Hangman Tree for the remains, takes the textbook to Ixia, kills the marsh spider whose fluid completes
# the list, hands the list in for the belladonna and takes it to Metheus; then relog, and Metheus, who has done his part, says so.
# Every script roll is pinned to 1, so every drop lands. Kaira calls the Alder spirit at the next visit, which a Boot test plays.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
